{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "kjv-psalms-107",
  "collection": "kjv-bible",
  "document_type": "bible_chapter",
  "number": 107,
  "title": "Psalms 107",
  "display_title": "Psalms 107",
  "translation": "King James Version",
  "translationCode": "KJV",
  "bookId": "psalms",
  "book": "Psalms",
  "bookName": "Psalms",
  "bookOrder": 19,
  "testament": "old",
  "chapter": 107,
  "sortOrder": 19107,
  "verseCount": 43,
  "aliases": [
    "Psalm",
    "Psalms",
    "Ps",
    "Psa",
    "Psm"
  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "O give thanks unto the LORD, for he is good: for his mercy endureth for ever.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "Let the redeemed of the LORD say so, whom he hath redeemed from the hand of the enemy;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "And gathered them out of the lands, from the east, and from the west, from the north, and from the south.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "They wandered in the wilderness in a solitary way; they found no city to dwell in.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "Hungry and thirsty, their soul fainted in them.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "Then they cried unto the LORD in their trouble, and he delivered them out of their distresses.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "And he led them forth by the right way, that they might go to a city of habitation.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "Oh that men would praise the LORD for his goodness, and for his wonderful works to the children of men!",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "For he satisfieth the longing soul, and filleth the hungry soul with goodness.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "Such as sit in darkness and in the shadow of death, being bound in affliction and iron;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:10"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-011",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 11,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:11",
      "numberLabel": "11",
      "text": "Because they rebelled against the words of God, and contemned the counsel of the most High:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:11",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:11"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-012",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 12,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:12",
      "numberLabel": "12",
      "text": "Therefore he brought down their heart with labour; they fell down, and there was none to help.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:12",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:12"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-013",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 13,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:13",
      "numberLabel": "13",
      "text": "Then they cried unto the LORD in their trouble, and he saved them out of their distresses.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:13",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-014",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 14,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:14",
      "numberLabel": "14",
      "text": "He brought them out of darkness and the shadow of death, and brake their bands in sunder.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:14",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:14"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-015",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 15,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:15",
      "numberLabel": "15",
      "text": "Oh that men would praise the LORD for his goodness, and for his wonderful works to the children of men!",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:15",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:15"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-016",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 16,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:16",
      "numberLabel": "16",
      "text": "For he hath broken the gates of brass, and cut the bars of iron in sunder.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:16",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:16"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-017",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 17,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:17",
      "numberLabel": "17",
      "text": "Fools because of their transgression, and because of their iniquities, are afflicted.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:17",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:17"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-018",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 18,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:18",
      "numberLabel": "18",
      "text": "Their soul abhorreth all manner of meat; and they draw near unto the gates of death.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:18",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:18"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-019",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 19,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:19",
      "numberLabel": "19",
      "text": "Then they cry unto the LORD in their trouble, and he saveth them out of their distresses.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:19",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:19"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-020",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 20,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:20",
      "numberLabel": "20",
      "text": "He sent his word, and healed them, and delivered them from their destructions.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:20",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:20"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-021",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 21,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:21",
      "numberLabel": "21",
      "text": "Oh that men would praise the LORD for his goodness, and for his wonderful works to the children of men!",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:21",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:21"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-022",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 22,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:22",
      "numberLabel": "22",
      "text": "And let them sacrifice the sacrifices of thanksgiving, and declare his works with rejoicing.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:22",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-023",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 23,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:23",
      "numberLabel": "23",
      "text": "They that go down to the sea in ships, that do business in great waters;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:23",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:23"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-024",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 24,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:24",
      "numberLabel": "24",
      "text": "These see the works of the LORD, and his wonders in the deep.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:24",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:24"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-025",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 25,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:25",
      "numberLabel": "25",
      "text": "For he commandeth, and raiseth the stormy wind, which lifteth up the waves thereof.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:25",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:25"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-026",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 26,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:26",
      "numberLabel": "26",
      "text": "They mount up to the heaven, they go down again to the depths: their soul is melted because of trouble.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:26",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:26"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-027",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 27,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:27",
      "numberLabel": "27",
      "text": "They reel to and fro, and stagger like a drunken man, and are at their wit’s end.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:27",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:27"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-028",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 28,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:28",
      "numberLabel": "28",
      "text": "Then they cry unto the LORD in their trouble, and he bringeth them out of their distresses.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:28",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:28"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-029",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 29,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:29",
      "numberLabel": "29",
      "text": "He maketh the storm a calm, so that the waves thereof are still.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:29",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:29"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-030",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 30,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:30",
      "numberLabel": "30",
      "text": "Then are they glad because they be quiet; so he bringeth them unto their desired haven.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:30",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:30"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-031",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 31,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:31",
      "numberLabel": "31",
      "text": "Oh that men would praise the LORD for his goodness, and for his wonderful works to the children of men!",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:31",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:31"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-032",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 32,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:32",
      "numberLabel": "32",
      "text": "Let them exalt him also in the congregation of the people, and praise him in the assembly of the elders.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:32",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:32"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-033",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 33,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:33",
      "numberLabel": "33",
      "text": "He turneth rivers into a wilderness, and the watersprings into dry ground;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:33",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:33"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-034",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 34,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:34",
      "numberLabel": "34",
      "text": "A fruitful land into barrenness, for the wickedness of them that dwell therein.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:34",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:34"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-035",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 35,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:35",
      "numberLabel": "35",
      "text": "He turneth the wilderness into a standing water, and dry ground into watersprings.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:35",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:35"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-036",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 36,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:36",
      "numberLabel": "36",
      "text": "And there he maketh the hungry to dwell, that they may prepare a city for habitation;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:36",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:36"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-037",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 37,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:37",
      "numberLabel": "37",
      "text": "And sow the fields, and plant vineyards, which may yield fruits of increase.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:37",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:37"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-038",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 38,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:38",
      "numberLabel": "38",
      "text": "He blesseth them also, so that they are multiplied greatly; and suffereth not their cattle to decrease.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:38",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:38"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-039",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 39,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:39",
      "numberLabel": "39",
      "text": "Again, they are minished and brought low through oppression, affliction, and sorrow.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:39",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:39"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-040",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 40,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:40",
      "numberLabel": "40",
      "text": "He poureth contempt upon princes, and causeth them to wander in the wilderness, where there is no way.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:40",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:40"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-041",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 41,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:41",
      "numberLabel": "41",
      "text": "Yet setteth he the poor on high from affliction, and maketh him families like a flock.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:41",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:41"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-042",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 42,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:42",
      "numberLabel": "42",
      "text": "The righteous shall see it, and rejoice: and all iniquity shall stop her mouth.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:42",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:42"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-043",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 43,
      "verseId": "kjv:psalms:107:43",
      "numberLabel": "43",
      "text": "Whoso is wise, and will observe these things, even they shall understand the lovingkindness of the LORD.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "Psalms 107:43",
        "verseKey": "kjv:psalms:107:43"
      }
    }
  ],
